category: Libs
build-depends: cygport libflint-devel libgmp-devel libmpfr-devel libssl-devel
sdesc: "Open source tool for computations in affine monoids, vector configurations, lattice polytopes, and rational cones (utilities)"
ldesc: "Normaliz is an open source tool for computations in affine monoids, vector
configurations, lattice polytopes, and rational cones. Normaliz also computes
algebraic polyhedra, i.e., polyhedra defined over real algebraic extensions of
Q."
skip:

homepage: https://github.com/Normaliz/Normaliz
